{
 "note": "an MQTT SSL key store holding several private keys, to a broker that requires a client certificate: the key the JDK's key manager (SunX509 or NewSunX509/PKIX) chooses for the issuers and signature schemes the broker's CertificateRequest names. Key stores and their generator: tests/files/asyncapi/mqtt-ssl/key-choice",
 "properties": {
  "tlsMutualAuthenticationRequired": "true",
  "tlsMutualAuthenticationCertificateChain": "{{files}}/tls/private-ca/ca-cert.pem"
 },
 "steps": [
  {
   "note": "the broker: every binary message this server receives (after its TLS, which requires a client certificate issued by its tlsMutualAuthenticationCertificateChain, a private CA, and names that CA in its CertificateRequest) but a lone zero byte is answered with an MQTT CONNACK, so a load connects exactly when the client presents a certificate the server accepts",
   "method": "PUT",
   "path": "/mockserver/expectation",
   "body": {
    "httpRequest": {
     "binaryData": "AA==",
     "not": true
    },
    "binaryResponse": {
     "binaryData": "IAMAAAA="
    }
   },
   "mask": [
    "\"id\" : \"[0-9a-f-]+\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "note": "SunX509 (the default): a key issued by another CA, then one issued by the CA the server names: the issuers filter the keys, the second connects",
   "method": "PUT",
   "path": "/mockserver/asyncapi",
   "body": {
    "spec": {
     "asyncapi": "2.6.0",
     "info": {
      "title": "Ssl",
      "version": "1"
     },
     "channels": {
      "orders": {
       "publish": {
        "message": {
         "payload": {
          "type": "object"
         }
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "brokerConfig": {
     "mqttBrokerUrl": "ssl://localhost:{{port}}",
     "publishOnLoad": false,
     "mqttSecurity": {
      "sslProperties": {
       "com.ibm.ssl.keyStore": "{{files}}/asyncapi/mqtt-ssl/key-choice/other-good.p12",
       "com.ibm.ssl.keyStorePassword": "changeit",
       "com.ibm.ssl.trustStore": "{{files}}/asyncapi/mqtt-ssl/trust.jks",
       "com.ibm.ssl.trustStorePassword": "changeit"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "maxMillis": 60000
  },
